<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Misconception #2: "esbui=
ld makes Vite fast"</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><em>esbuild contributes to speed=
, but architecture change is more important. Even if Webpack used esbuild, =
it would still be slower because of bundle-first approach.</em></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Misconception #3: "Vite =
can't handle complex projects"</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><em>Early Vite versions had limi=
tations, but modern Vite handles complex enterprise applications. Netflix, =
Adobe, GitLab =C4=91=C3=A3 migrate successfully.</em></p>
