<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=8E=AF Tea=
ching &amp; Knowledge Transfer</h3>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">Effective Analogies</h=
4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>The Restaurant Analogy (=
Extended)</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><em>T=C3=B4i s=E1=BB=AD d=E1=BB=
=A5ng extended restaurant analogy =C4=91=E1=BB=83 explain build tools:</em>=
</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Traditional Restaurant (=
Webpack):</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Chef prepares ALL menu items be=
fore opening</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Customer orders =E2=86=92 immed=
iately served (fast serving)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Change recipe =E2=86=92 must re=
make all affected dishes</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Consistent quality, but long pr=
ep time</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Kitchen can handle complex, mul=
ti-step dishes</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Modern Fast-Casual (Vite=
):</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Prep common ingredients ahead (=
dependency pre-bundling)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Customer orders =E2=86=92 cook =
fresh (on-demand transformation)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Change recipe =E2=86=92 only af=
fects new orders</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Fast service, but limited to si=
mpler dishes initially</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Food Truck (Pure ES Modu=
les):</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">No prep, cook everything from s=
cratch per order</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Very fresh, but can be slow for=
 complex orders</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Limited menu (browser support l=
imitations)</li>
</ul>
