ts |
</span><span>      | Large Legacy App | Webpack | Ecosystem support, gradua=
l migration |
</span><span>      | Component Library | Rollup | Library-optimized bundlin=
g |
</span><span>      | Micro-frontend | Webpack + MF | Runtime composition su=
pport |
