<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">How we optimize for human produ=
ctivity</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">How we build systems that evolv=
e gracefully</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>These are the skills tha=
t transcend any specific tool or technology.</strong></p>
<hr class=3D"border-border-300 my-2">
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>=F0=9F=9A=80 To the deve=
lopers reading this</strong>: Whether you choose Webpack, Vite, or whatever=
 comes next, remember that the goal isn't to master every tool - it's to de=
velop judgment about when and how to apply the right tool for the right con=
text.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>=F0=9F=8E=AF To the team=
s evaluating these tools</strong>: Take the time to understand your specifi=
c constraints, measure your current state, pilot carefully, and make data-d=
riven decisions. The "fastest" tool isn't always the "best" tool for your c=
ontext.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>=F0=9F=8C=9F To the orga=
nizations investing in developer platforms</strong>: Developer experience i=
s not a cost center - it's a competitive advantage. Invest accordingly.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><em>The future belongs to teams =
that can adapt quickly while maintaining quality. Build tools are just one =
piece of that puzzle, but they're a important piece that touches every deve=
